          <p>You must be legally capable of accepting these Terms. The Service is not directed to children under 13. You must provide accurate account information, keep your credentials confidential and promptly notify us if you suspect unauthorized access. You are responsible for activity performed through your account unless applicable law provides otherwise.</p>

          <h2>3. What the Service does</h2>
          <p>Panic Button lets you configure emergency contacts and deliberately activate an SOS alert. Depending on your settings and permissions, an alert can send your identity, contact information and location through email, Telegram, WhatsApp and/or SMS; share a private alert page and live route; record an SOS video; and upload that recording to a connected Google Drive account.</p>

          <section class="legal-safety">
