            <p><strong>Panic Button is not an emergency-response service, alarm monitoring service or substitute for police, fire, medical or other official emergency services.</strong> Alerts depend on the device, battery, operating-system restrictions, permissions, GPS, internet and mobile networks, our systems and third-party providers. Delivery, timing, location accuracy, recording and availability are not guaranteed. In an emergency, contact the official emergency services available in your location whenever possible.</p>
          </section>

          <h2>5. Permissions, emergency contacts and consent</h2>
